项飙成为年轻人的顶流偶像，他直言14亿人都在同一场比赛，拆解了一代人的生存焦虑。</blockquote><br/><br/>欢迎大家推荐我们的邮件周报给身边不方便科学上网的朋友，订阅链接：<a href="https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://outsightchina-cn.pages.dev/</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/kvrbhoT7qxqNroMpRIkYU9lGfXmnxYs4uymKFcsaAetpFoDKqUX9mJKgLe5PbmvvZ_AVzgsNHPzcLSistN4647T_XRU_w0Y6WyqDllu6w5-GpoT5Lfco-wGDBK7grObq5VcOy-x5QURBeM2a30mPt01GSbqsN9TjWVGOeNEMeKyTcaLEH8yDPh18z3_skRrJcmoDkKGfeGQi0br7QieqHMCfsC59rPjRCs_F3EuWPgQI2Topvb1ktAwTEyvQCui9yEhOyk4XekTS37vaSMO-kE8GH_7KAe8HgSgLpHPFxNvbN14VO9QXO2zFiwjtT5QWqJMGgHpWvg4XCKsKFOcshA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
