<item>
<title>习特会达八点成果共识中媒：美各界高度评价 外媒：实际成果不多习近平访美与特朗普会谈，中国外交部公布八点成果共识，包括构建</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10245</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10245</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:33:43 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>习特会达八点成果共识<br/>中媒：美各界高度评价 外媒：实际成果不多</b><br/><br/>习近平访美与特朗普会谈，中国外交部公布八点成果共识，包括构建“基于尊重、公平、对等的中美建设性战略稳定关系”、建立人工智能对话等。新华社称“美国各界人士高度评价”此访；《环球时报》称中美竞争应是“赛跑”而非“角斗”，两国“应该成为伙伴而不是对手”。<br/><br/> 《华尔街日报》则指，中国仍从德黑兰购买石油并向伊朗运送无人机、导弹零部件，习近平呼吁美方“坚持反对‘台独’的正确立场”，显示“台湾，而非贸易，才是真正的核心目标”。法广称习对伊朗的表态“很笼统”，“唯一可见的成果”是贸易休战延长两个月。<br/><br/>港媒称，美方礼遇“是对中国大国地位的清醒认知”，但也承认互访“实际达成的成果不多”，更多是表达“斗而不破”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE">#台湾</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD">#美国</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《中国外交部》<a href="https://www.fmprc.gov.cn/zyxw/202609/t20260926_12031616.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中美达成八点成果共识</a><br/>《华尔街日报》<a href="https://cn.wsj.com/articles/%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E4%B8%8E%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E7%99%BD%E5%AE%AB%E4%B9%8B%E4%BC%9A%E7%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E5%BC%80%E5%9C%BA-%E7%A4%BC%E4%BB%AA%E9%9A%86%E9%87%8D-a8b09a27" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">尽管会晤充满友好仪式与外交礼节，特朗普政府并未取得重大政策让步，而习近平则借此展示了与美国领导人平起平坐的形象。</a><br/>《法广》<a href="https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260924-%E7%89%B9%E4%B9%A0%E4%BC%9A%E6%8E%92%E5%9C%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E5%B0%8F-%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E9%9A%BE%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">特习会排场大效果小 重大问题难突破</a><br/>《新华社》<a href="https://m.gmw.cn/2026-09/26/content_39021198.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">特稿｜为中美关系提供新的战略指引——美国各界高度评价习近平主席对美国进行国事访问</a><br/>《环球时报》<a href="https://opinion.huanqiu.com/article/4TLa7PXP79y" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">社评：中美应该成为伙伴而不是对手</a><br/>《香港01》<a href="https://global.hk01.com/article/60393964?utm_source=01articlecopy&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">习近平访美｜礼遇是表面　实力是底色　选择更关键 | 香港01</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Ma08nBoMG7lK9cjoREbq2x6Zg6x25woK3jqYJVB3BiOLXxfShQUpHuPMcUogy1JHyyDFlHiYInNYmQXAqiQl9gDxdHASeDXogZPDlHUqlRpSXbtW1StqHhz5WGBeZunDHmaM6nklGL3O_JHTXCggRhimJT_QBI3TKytwVlvXNp1UtsDpjF4mFLRC8Uf2l17uG_I7nVCeA1BwmaCYB6BcZgJBU1GDsz3kDZOod3dLA5c8OJAKoaDTg62gCAecCwkxVxzHoDzSr0BQpKkOBAnm5VMYwVE0bLj4NtB-XDvW60KPgUFCh9_DTh5Q7CfGraTUZlnj-CHSFbgVuERIMV7OKQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/py1zCFIOvIMXbiOXeUR-8e7FfjWGu4XkXg9BQlbiVUk8zJr-gW9-jESR7uusjGMrL-5nV49c729VYmH_HqoAqrcJwELjVXZCaoEsyrpNFDaQLJe_CjLNsQnT8zgjfU4VLUpkZv7D2-X4U_FrqufheslLQ0Z2BjsPNLWRR08To3Hlm3I6bpIb6-ysB0gBVY8CV5sqTs5Qmub-kjMhuBe4KVusLxAvbruJvhqZ3t-YdbuXE2kh8ZsVglMYiQduL2kckZQilX7IP_WUgP97flDHPss3mYXKT_e2y12DJM57bHyU9Ral7MmOU2DNjFXgfKso1bdhyuMj51Z8S5Las0E3Fg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/MyUD5yrlnsOaOBWsxS4gkrOOg6LpJJpK7yj5Qyq6CLV9EN_iuWV5b_-Mt7nxL-6tH68ZXqir-GX30kYRri-yAupoWMa40UALrJyx8s-AE0hYf9gqiM_DomOY4VeYnbD-p3BTkvvsTUNECrNuGc_MBaUhxZXJ7h33JraR_QbSuBNNWVz9itVdhYvoD1T6OTCHBFw1LVKGraoh8nmd2yI3Kcj4TztOItMhtxuzADmU-EO6PhZzUoSnTx6Nax35RoElf9XXsDYQb10QBcGeob_ZUA8QXWA2fpPn2X7bvPWede1Gavv9ZCkEOGIHdZAFUooMlOsD47OfBBbjpoVZRE62NA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/sV-L6OO0EoO_3wt2RFrtWwAzt-TgyDjjFXFDSzOQOtFcUhiugofXgOfR3UqeWB3QOIJ-arQ2lGr6lWu66XgNdnFsS0a1Wc9eL1UEwl12qi29ZZxT0-miWssfzDuTjiShM7iAOvaQY717fxfYvRoOocyZHLvZGmaJF29to2hQSBRbuOqQ7MwFaMkMSw9ZMBN5cIpEsRPF_w1qJV5